 5 INNER GERMAN BORDER  OPEN   WOPR                    COR1,2
 6 ELBE                 ROUGH  WOPR                    COR3,4
 7 ODER                 CITY   WOPR                    AIR1
AIR1 IN CHANNEL PORTS: HELP

ORDERS: MOVE, ATTACK, HOLD, ESCALATE.
STATUS SHOWS THE MAP; END HOLDS THE REST OF THIS TURN'S UNITS.
  MOVE <REGION>: AS FAR AS THE UNIT'S MOVE, NOT THROUGH THE ENEMY.
  ATTACK <REGION>: AN ENEMY IN RANGE.
  HOLD: STAY PUT.
  ESCALATE: CLIMB ONE RUNG OF THE LADDER (ONCE A TURN).
RESULTS: NE NO EFFECT; AE THE ATTACKER LOSES A STEP; EX BOTH DO;
DR THE DEFENDER FALLS BACK (OR LOSES A STEP); DE THE DEFENDER LOSES A STEP.
